    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33128" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκτύφω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῡ]</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>burn in a slow fire</i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξύθυψεν</span> (sic, post <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξήια</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">:
			ἐξέκαυσεν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>:—metaph. in 
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔρωτα ἐκτύφεσθαι</span>
			<i>light a slow fire</i>
			<i>of</i> love, <i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				3.50
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, aor. 2
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξετύφην <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῠ]</span>, ἐξ. κλαίουσα</span> my face <i>swelled
				up</i> with weeping, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				<u>Epit.Fr.</u>
				9
			</span></i>.</div>
